#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]syntax-highlighted closed display with an empty-query placeholder, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]accent-driven border/sigil/completion colors, and click-to-edit -- and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]adopt it on the two bars that are already persistent.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Persistent query bar on Bead and File[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]panes[dim] · [dim][/dim]after chrome[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]panes: make BeadFilterBar and FileFilterBar persistent, add a single [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`_sync_query_bar` funnel that keeps each idle bar's text and status [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]truthful, and stop echoing the active query as chips in those panes' [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]identity headers.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Persistent query bar on Plan and every document provider[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]documents[dim] · [dim][/dim]after panes[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]documents: make PlanFilterBar persistent for the Plan pane and every [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`ref:<kind>` provider pane, surface deep-archive coverage in the idle [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]status lane, and delete the now-unused filter-token echo from the shared[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]scope renderer.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Always-on invariant, conformance, and visual grammar docs[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]grammar[dim] · [dim][/dim]after documents[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]grammar: add the cross-pane regression that every non-degraded resolved [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sub-tab mounts a visible, read-only query bar in its own accent, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rewri